      "Controlling MLLMs The researchers also demonstrated how multimodal model diffing can be used to control the behavior of MLLMs. By modifying the features that are unique to the multimodal model, they were able to influence the model's predictions and generate different outputs. This level of control is essential for ensuring that MLLMs are used responsibly and for preventing potential biases or errors.",
